/-
  The valuation subring as a principal ideal domain, and its denominators in a finite extension.

  Four statements about a valuation subring `V` of a field and a finite extension:

  * if `V` has finitely many residue classes below the size of an extension, two elements `a i` of
    `V` can be separated by a single `z` that stays in `V` and has `z - a i` non-integral — the splitting
    criterion of a complete residue system;
  * `V` intersected with a finite-dimensional subalgebra `K[f]` generated by a transcendental element is
    a principal ideal domain;
  * membership in every valuation subring of a family is decided by the subrings alone (`mem_of_forall_
    mem_iff_of_subset`);
  * in a finite-dimensional extension, a sufficiently high power of the inverse of a transcendental
    element clears denominators (`exists_mul_pow_inv_mem_of_finiteDimensional_adjoin`).

  These are the valuation-side lemmas the regular prolongation's residue computation consumes.

  Transcribed from the pin's proof files (pinned `aa2d8b3`)
  `P2M/Sol/S_ValuationSubring_exists_sub_mem_nonunits_of_finrank_le_card.lean` (337 lines),
  `…_isPrincipalIdealRing_of_finiteDimensional_adjoin.lean` (259),
  `…_mem_of_forall_mem_iff_of_subset.lean` (126) and
  `…_exists_mul_pow_inv_mem_of_finiteDimensional_adjoin.lean` (112), with the statements from their
  wrappers `Theorems/Thm_ValuationSubring_*.lean`.

  spec-pin: Theorems/Thm_ValuationSubring_exists_sub_mem_nonunits_of_finrank_le_card.lean
  spec-pin: P2M/Sol/S_ValuationSubring_exists_sub_mem_nonunits_of_finrank_le_card.lean
  spec-pin: Theorems/Thm_ValuationSubring_isPrincipalIdealRing_of_finiteDimensional_adjoin.lean
  spec-pin: P2M/Sol/S_ValuationSubring_isPrincipalIdealRing_of_finiteDimensional_adjoin.lean
  spec-pin: Theorems/Thm_ValuationSubring_mem_of_forall_mem_iff_of_subset.lean
  spec-pin: P2M/Sol/S_ValuationSubring_mem_of_forall_mem_iff_of_subset.lean
  spec-pin: Theorems/Thm_ValuationSubring_exists_mul_pow_inv_mem_of_finiteDimensional_adjoin.lean
  spec-pin: P2M/Sol/S_ValuationSubring_exists_mul_pow_inv_mem_of_finiteDimensional_adjoin.lean
-/
